# Server-side only — never expose to the client (no VITE_ prefix).
# Loaded by: Vite middleware via loadEnv(.env / .env.local), Vercel env, and
# `tsx --env-file=.env` for calibrate:skirmish. Vite does not put this into
# process.env automatically — the decide plugin reads it through loadEnv.
TYPESAFE_API_KEY=
